{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14382","headline":"赋得秋河曙耿耿 · 陈润","name":"赋得秋河曙耿耿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚望秋高夜，微明欲曙河。\n桥成鹊已去，机罢女应过。\n月上殊开练，云行类动波。\n寻源不可到，耿耿复如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈润","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}